OL,4,CTown's lack of EV chargers puts off    
OL,5,Cdrivers - councillor                   
OL,6,GA town's lack of charging facilities   
OL,7,Gis discouraging drivers from owning    
OL,8,Gelectric vehicles (EVs), a councillor  
OL,9,Ghas said.                              
OL,11,FEmily Young, a councillor in Alton,    
OL,12,FHampshire, said four chargers were     
OL,13,Fsupposed to have been installed at a   
OL,14,FLidl supermarket when it opened in     
OL,15,F2023.                                  
OL,17,FShe said another charger in the town   
OL,18,Fcentre had been broken since 2022,     
OL,19,Fwhile four EV stations at the edge-of- 
OL,20,Ftown Alton Sports Centre were only     
OL,21,Frecently repaired.                     
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
