OL,4,CResidents keep ashes at home due to    
OL,5,Clack of graves                         
OL,6,GResidents in a Hampshire village have  
OL,7,Gsaid they are being forced to keep the 
OL,8,Gashes of their loved ones at home      
OL,9,Gbecause they have nowhere to bury them 
OL,10,Gnearby.                                
OL,12,FPeople in South Wonston said their 20- 
OL,13,Fyear campaign for a burial ground had  
OL,14,Fbeen blocked by the Ministry of        
OL,15,FDefence (MoD).                         
OL,17,FCampaigners, including members of the  
OL,18,Fparish council, said they had          
OL,19,Fidentified a suitable piece of land,   
OL,20,Fbut were being refused permission to   
OL,21,Fuse it.                                
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
